[00:00.01]Way up in the sky
{"高悬于天际"}
[00:01.51]There used to be a heartbeat
{"曾有心跳在此搏动"}
[00:03.18]A full of the folly, so-called civilization
{"充斥着愚行 所谓文明"}
[00:06.40]It’s only me who knows that
{"唯有我知晓真相"}
[00:07.83]It’s hideous yet splendid
{"丑陋却壮丽"}
[00:09.48]The animas you broke and left to live
{"你摧毁又遗弃的生灵"}
[00:12.83]The sky is tore down
{"苍穹被撕裂"}
[00:14.25]Like it was an answer
{"仿佛这就是答案"}
[00:15.92]Cuz so beautifully done and fallen
{"因它如此完美地坠落"}
[00:17.81]It was your answer
{"那是你的答案"}
[00:19.00]Who wanna take it back when the end teaches emotions?
{"当终结教会情感 谁还想挽回？"}
[00:22.27]Your breath taught me an ancient law of life
{"你的呼吸向我传授古老生命法则"}
[00:26.98]From miles away
{"从千里之外"}
[00:28.18]Flew to tell you how this world you sacrificed
{"飞来告诉你这被你牺牲的世界"}
[00:33.33]To save me
{"为拯救我"}
[00:34.55]Is shining in my eyes to show in your eyes
{"在我眼中闪耀 映照进你眼底"}
[00:37.53]But found out it was only a dream
{"却发现不过是场幻梦"}
[00:39.73]Blinks taken away
{"转瞬被夺走"}
[00:41.01]Wish you heard me in here, an empty voice
{"愿你能听见这空谷回音"}
[00:46.14]"To save me"
{"为拯救我"}
[00:47.36]Is shining in my eyes to drop in your eyes
{"在我眼中闪耀 滴落进你眼底"}
[00:50.37]Is it too late to love? For a bit, I feel your answer
{"去爱是否太迟？我短暂感受到你的答案"}
[00:53.80]Those words that you gave me
{"你赠予我的话语"}
[00:55.90]I’ll carve them to my core
{"我将铭刻至灵魂深处"}
[00:57.53]It’s me myself who can tell how it’s ended and started
{"唯有我能诉说这始终"}
[01:00.60]So I’m just singing aloud to you
{"所以我只是大声为你歌唱"}
[01:02.92]Is it too late to love? For a bit, I feel your answer
{"现在说爱是否太迟？我隐约感受到你的答案"}
[01:06.93]The whole world with the order
{"整个世界按部就班"}
[01:08.62]Not yet elucidated
{"尚未阐明"}
[01:10.34]It’s me myself who can tell how it’s enchanted
{"唯有我自己知晓这魔力从何而来"}
[01:13.36]So I’m just singing alone to you
{"所以我只是独自为你歌唱"}
[01:15.76]Is it too late to love? For a bit, I feel your answer, darling
{"现在说爱是否太迟？亲爱的 我隐约感受到你的答案"}
[01:31.97]A fairy tale about the dystopia
{"关于反乌托邦的童话"}
[01:34.93]Has come true like the mother’s kindness
{"如母亲般温柔地成真了"}
[01:38.38]The lives we lived the memories we have left, the Chronicle we walked along
{"我们经历的人生 留下的记忆 共同走过的编年史"}
[01:44.83]In 2099, we realized
{"在2099年 我们终于明白"}
[01:47.68]We were not the first to reach the end
{"我们并非首批抵达终点的人"}
[01:51.22]The sunshine gently holds me tight and tight
{"阳光温柔地将我紧紧拥抱"}
[01:54.32]Makes me feel like an eternity
{"让我恍若置身永恒"}
[02:00.42]From miles away
{"从千里之外"}
[02:01.73]Flew to find you, how this put an end to you
{"飞奔向你的结局如何降临"}
[02:06.83]Like magic
{"如同魔法"}
[02:08.00]It gulps you down, drowned in the line
{"它将你吞噬 淹没在界限里"}
[02:11.01]And yet the sun comes from your place
{"然而阳光仍从你的方向升起"}
[02:13.22]Blinks taken away
{"被夺走的眨眼瞬间"}
[02:14.48]Wish you heard me in here, an empty voice
{"多希望你能听见这空荡回响"}
[02:19.53]"To save me"
{"来拯救我"}
[02:20.85]Is shining in my eyes to drop in your eyes
{"在我眼中闪烁 最终落入你眼底"}
[02:23.82]Is it too late to love? For a bit, I feel your answer
{"现在说爱是否太迟？我隐约感受到你的答案"}
[02:27.19]Those words that you gave me
{"你曾赠予我的那些话语"}
[02:29.39]I’ll carve them to my core
{"我会将它们铭刻于心"}
[02:30.97]It’s me myself who can tell how it’s ended and started
{"唯有我能诉说这始终"}
[02:34.08]So I’m just singing aloud to you
{"所以我只是对你放声歌唱"}
[02:36.39]Is it too late to love? For a bit, I feel your answer
{"去爱是否已太迟？我隐约感受到你的答案"}
[02:40.20]When your soul remembers
{"当你的灵魂忆起"}
[02:42.20]To love something once more
{"再度爱上某物的感觉"}
[02:43.80]May you embrace it, never ever let it hurt you
{"愿你能拥抱它 永远别让它伤害你"}
[02:46.83]So I’m just singing aloud to you
{"所以我只是对你放声歌唱"}
[02:49.28]Is it too late to love? For a bit, I feel your answer, darling
{"去爱是否已太迟？亲爱的 我隐约感受到你的答案"}
